#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A brief introduction to the course structure, intended audience, and to the "
"variational quantum eigensolver."
msgstr ""
"Isang maikling panimula sa istruktura ng kurso, target na audience, at sa "
"variational quantum eigensolver."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: sidebar_label
#, no-wrap
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Panimula"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"{/* cspell:ignore Lipinska allowfullscreen webkitallowfullscreen "
"mozallowfullscreen oallowfullscreen msallowfullscreen referrerpolicy Fedorov"
" */}\n"
msgstr ""
"{/* cspell:ignore Lipinska allowfullscreen webkitallowfullscreen "
"mozallowfullscreen oallowfullscreen msallowfullscreen referrerpolicy Fedorov"
" */}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This course is a focused introduction to the variational quantum eigensolver"
" (VQE), including the application of VQE to chemistry. The course is "
"intended for technical practitioners of quantum computing who are interested"
" in applying quantum computing to chemical, biochemical, or biophysical "
"problems. This course covers important elements of a VQE calculation, "
"including these:\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang kursong ito ay isang nakatuong panimula sa variational quantum "
"eigensolver (VQE), kasama ang paggamit ng VQE sa chemistry. Ang kurso ay "
"para sa mga teknikal na practitioner ng quantum computing na interesado sa "
"pag-apply ng quantum computing sa mga problema sa kemikal, biochemical, o "
"biophysical. Saklaw ng kursong ito ang mga mahahalagang bahagi ng isang VQE "
"na kalkulasyon, kasama ang mga ito:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Hamiltonian\n"
msgstr "Hamiltonian\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Ansatz\n"
msgstr "Ansatz\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Classical optimizer\n"
msgstr "Classical optimizer\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"All these elements are brought together to build VQE calculations on Qiskit "
"Runtime Primitives, primarily Estimator. For information about primitives "
"see the [documentation](/guides/primitives). In setting up a VQE "
"calculation, we will follow the standard Qiskit patterns framework:\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang lahat ng mga elementong ito ay pinagsama-sama upang bumuo ng mga VQE na "
"kalkulasyon sa Qiskit Runtime Primitives, pangunahin ang Estimator. Para sa "
"impormasyon tungkol sa mga primitive, tingnan ang "
"[dokumentasyon](/guides/primitives). Sa pag-set up ng isang VQE na "
"kalkulasyon, susundin natin ang standard na Qiskit patterns framework:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Map classical inputs to a quantum problem\n"
msgstr "I-map ang mga classical na input sa isang quantum na problema\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Optimize problem for quantum execution\n"
msgstr "I-optimize ang problema para sa quantum na pagpapatupad\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Execute using Qiskit Runtime primitives\n"
msgstr "Ipatupad gamit ang mga Qiskit Runtime primitive\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Post-process, return result in classical format\n"
msgstr "Post-process, ibalik ang resulta sa classical na format\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Some explanation of the framework will be found throughout this course, but "
"for a complete explanation with examples of Qiskit patterns, see [this "
"documentation](/guides/intro-to-patterns).\n"
msgstr ""
"Makikita ang ilang paliwanag ng framework sa buong kursong ito, ngunit para "
"sa kumpletong paliwanag na may mga halimbawa ng Qiskit patterns, tingnan ang"
" [dokumentasyong ito](/guides/intro-to-patterns).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We recommend planning to devote approximately 6-10 hours to the completion "
"of this course. The videos and reading are likely to take two hours to "
"complete. The remaining time is for executing and modifying code cells, "
"completing quiz questions, and reading linked documentation.\n"
msgstr ""
"Inirerekomenda naming maglaan ng humigit-kumulang 6-10 oras para makumpleto "
"ang kursong ito. Ang mga video at pagbabasa ay malamang na tatagal ng "
"dalawang oras. Ang natitirang oras ay para sa pagpapatupad at pagbabago ng "
"mga code cell, pagsagot sa mga quiz na tanong, at pagbabasa ng naka-link na "
"dokumentasyon.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"IBM Quantum&reg; has other upskilling offerings related to VQE. If you are "
"already familiar with the components of VQE and simply wish to put it into "
"practice, see our tutorial: [Ground-state energy estimation of the "
"Heisenberg chain with VQE](/tutorials/spin-chain-vqe).\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang IBM Quantum&reg; ay may iba pang mga upskilling offering na may "
"kaugnayan sa VQE. Kung pamilyar ka na sa mga bahagi ng VQE at nais mo lamang"
" itong isabuhay, tingnan ang aming tutorial: [Ground-state energy estimation"
" of the Heisenberg chain with VQE](/tutorials/spin-chain-vqe).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Overview of VQE {#overview-of-vqe}"
msgstr "Pangkalahatang-ideya ng VQE {#overview-of-vqe}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Let's begin our study of VQE by watching this overview video, presented by "
"the IBM Quantum Americas Lead for Quantum Innovation Centers, Dr. Victoria "
"Lipinska.\n"
msgstr ""
"Simulan natin ang ating pag-aaral ng VQE sa pamamagitan ng panonood ng "
"pangkalahatang-ideyang video na ito, na ipinakita ng IBM Quantum Americas "
"Lead para sa Quantum Innovation Centers, si Dr. Victoria Lipinska.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You will learn what VQE is, what it can do, and why it is likely to be "
"useful in the near-term over other quantum computing algorithms.\n"
msgstr ""
"Matututunan mo kung ano ang VQE, kung ano ang magagawa nito, at kung bakit "
"malamang na magiging kapaki-pakinabang ito sa near-term kumpara sa iba pang "
"mga quantum computing algorithm.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<IBMVideo id=\"132414895\" title=\"Victoria Lipinska gives an overview of "
"VQE, what it can do, and why it is likely to be useful in the near-"
"term.\"/>\n"
msgstr ""
"<IBMVideo id=\"132414895\" title=\"Victoria Lipinska gives an overview of "
"VQE, what it can do, and why it is likely to be useful in the near-"
